# Scene 5 — "Against Hubble" (~90 s)
# Beats: the user's TEC 140 pillars beside the Hubble Heritage rendition;
# lossless colour transport (a fitted stretch + colour mixer — the data
# untouched); Measure PSF with star annotations.
# MANUAL moments (presenter): click "Annotate stars" in the PSF report;
# zoom into the gold ellipses.
# NOTE: uses the BXT5 master (fast open). For the full 768 MB master,
# pre-open it before recording starts.
action clear_list
open pillars_of_creation_Hubble.webp
waitloaded
open PSF_comparison/M16_cropped_SHO_combination_SHO_stars_BXT5.xisf
waitloaded
autostf
sleep 2000
split 1x2
sleep 3000
# lossless colour transport toward Hubble: per-channel curves + a fitted
# 3x3 colour mixer, alternated — no pixel is written
activate 2
transport 1 100 stretch colour
sleep 5000
# the PSF, measured from the image's own stars (report dialog appears;
# presenter clicks "Annotate stars" and zooms into the ellipses)
action measure_psf
